 "remarks": "Exceptional new build just completed by SIR Development, Westport's premier builder w/ 30+ yrs experience & 300+ homes. Leave the city for the burbs but keep the conveniences. Just a short walk to Starbucks, Stiles Market, Aux Delice, Little Barn & Big Y Plaza. Short ride to great schools, train & beach. This award winning layout and design has 5 BDRMs and is beautifully detailed across 4 finished levels with top SIR SIGNATURE HOME finishes - Custom Eat-in Kitchen with sleek white cabinetry, oak accents, quartz countertops & backsplash, stainless steel appliances opens to spacious Family Rm w/ fireplace and sliding glass drs lead to granite patio w/ level fenced backyard w/room for pool. 1st flr study with custom built-ins, generous formal DR, mudroom & powder rm. Spacious Master BR Suite has spa bath and 2 Walk-in Closets. Fin 3rd Flr w/5th BR and full bath. Fin walk-out LL has custom built-ins, gym, media room, bonus room & full bath. Terrific layout, style, property & neighborhood. City water, sewer & propane gas. Move-in ready with beautiful landscaping & fence to ensure privacy, perfectly sized to appreciate suburban life. Taxes TBD. Builder's 1 year warranty included.",
